{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0DPV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Complexesstack_{X/B} \\to B$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-complexes-qs-lfp}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:def74b01da1fd9a050ccf156fdb2adddf09779a3ffe7b03959f2aeadb2eb339a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:042e8c4b9ddae0282076f61775ef1bf5646254e800c99c144c7f178234879bb5", "source_text": "The morphism <MATH_0001> is quasi-separated and\nlocally of finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d247279dea57e3b75173d3b1b9d3388de47d1b19f70e8576a1e81ff047a93078", "unit_id": "tag:0DPX:statement"}
{"chapter": "moduli", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0DPV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Complexesstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Complexesstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Complexesstack_{X/B} \\to B$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-complexes-diagonal-affine-fp}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{stacks-limits-proposition-characterize-locally-finite-presentation}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{quot-lemma-complexes-limits}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ee50a3029a6b75945e1620c651444d9796335bd64f97c8f35b28660e54c8bd2b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:779af4419dc07fbcd296b4308840a0a259fc64718462166e92956b9799e75256", "source_text": "To check <MATH_0001> is quasi-separated we have to\nshow that its diagonal is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\nThis is immediate from Lemma <REF_0001>.\nTo prove that <MATH_0002> is locally of finite\npresentation, we have to show that <MATH_0003>\nis limit preserving, see\nLimits of Stacks, Proposition\n<REF_0002>.\nThis follows from Quot, Lemma <REF_0003>\n(small detail omitted).\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:8635f79a20caf0eca102c810175743750dc45a81be41a0893df50f804d841d5b", "unit_id": "tag:0DPX:proof"}
